Parametric ornate picture frame, generated around a frameless canvas painting
and split into bed-sized dovetailed segments. The generator, its profile,
segmentation, ornament and clip helper files plus the upstream LICENSE are
vendored verbatim from the pinned commit; the build scripts and the story
images are not vendored.

